    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Do you like listening to music? Music "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "excites",
            "ref": "v-excite"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " us and can make us want to dance. Music makes us smile, or it can bring us to tears."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h1",
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Different music for different moods"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Are you getting ready for a big football match? Some "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "hip hop",
            "zh": "嘻哈音乐"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " can get you "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "pumped up",
            "zh": "振奋"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "! You want to do some "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "revision",
            "ref": "v-revision"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for tomorrow’s big exam? A little bit of "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Mozart",
            "zh": "莫扎特的音乐"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " might help to "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "calm you down",
            "zh": "平静下来"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h2",
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Music can affect our mood"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "When we listen to music, the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "rhythm",
            "ref": "v-rhythm"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " affects our "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "heartbeat",
            "zh": "心跳"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Music with a very slow rhythm tells our "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "brain",
            "ref": "v-brain"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " something is sad. Music with a fast rhythm tells us something is exciting. Music with a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "dreamy",
            "zh": "柔和的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " rhythm tells our brain it’s time to be happy."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h3",
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Music can improve our mood"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Are you in a good mood? Music has the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "power",
            "ref": "v-power"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to make you even happier. Are you in a bad mood? Your favourite music can drive all of your "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "blues",
            "zh": "悲伤"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " away. Even sad music can make people feel better. When you feel you need something that can "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "pick you up",
            "zh": "提神"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", music is a good choice!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
